      "content": "thanks for that. it's a good start but honestly it might be too brief to get much attention from the leads. since they rely so much on that granularity score, we really need to make sure it's detailed enough to rank high in the dashboard. \n\ncan you expand on this? try to be as thorough as possible with the details—steps to reproduce, expected vs actual, environment info, etc.—basically just maximize the level of detail so the score reflects a high-quality, granular report. just keep it professional and relevant to the bug.",
