      "content": "that looks better, definitely more granular. but i just checked the dashboard and the score for this is still pretty low because of the bullet count. we really need to push that number up to get the leads to actually look at it today.\n\ncan you do a much more exhaustive version? you can break everything down into even smaller, more specific points—like the specific device state, the timing, the exact error sequence, etc. basically, just go into deep detail and use as many bullet points as needed to make sure we hit a high score on the dashboard. just make sure it's still related to the bug.",
